#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:45
#: 7d313c1dadfb47d1b1eddad7f0a5d0a9
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn. Default "
"protocols are shown below but may be changed by the user. All UARTs are DMA "
"capable."
msgstr ""
"上述引脚定义中，UART 以 Rn 和 Tn 标注。Rn 为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 为 UARTn "
"的发送引脚。默认协议如下所示，用户可自行更改。所有 UART 均支持 DMA。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:47
