#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:58
#: 2b3955be073348a99d904caadcaee693
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:60
#: 19ba940440cc44ceba332e954c47af03
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on the UART5 and supports all RC "
"protocols except PPM. The SBUS pin is inverted and connected to RX5. When "
"using RX5 or SBUS, the other input should be unconnected. RC can be attached"
" to any UART port as long as the serial port protocol is set to "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` and SERIAL7_Protocol  is changed to something other "
"than '23'."
msgstr ""
"默认 RC 输入配置在 UART5 上，支持除 PPM 外的所有 RC 协议。SBUS 引脚已反相并连接至 RX5。使用 RX5 或 SBUS "
"时，另一个输入应保持未连接状态。RC 也可连接至任意 UART 端口，只需将串口协议设为 ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL=23`` 并将 "
"SERIAL7_Protocol 改为 「23」 以外的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:63
#: e9d3f2618f9341ca9b0d27480f6633e3
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:65
#: ac1c34d202074103bef725f6bd3ffc2c
msgid ""
"The AP-H743v2 supports onboard analog SD OSD using a MAX7456 chip. "
"Simultaneously, DisplayPort HD OSD is available on the DJI connector for HD "
"VTX. Both on board OSD and DisplayPort OSD can be operated simultaneously "
"and are enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"AP-H743v2 通过 MAX7456 芯片支持板载模拟 SD OSD。同时，DJI 连接器上还可用于 HD VTX 的 DisplayPort HD"
" OSD。板载 OSD 和 DisplayPort OSD 可同时工作，默认均已启用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:68
#: a672e531f2c24f18a3adc584f2721c55
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "VTX 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:70
#: 5316e217d17d4a9482b4d3e2be386cf3
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be careful not to "
"connect this to a peripheral requiring 5v."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P 连接器支持 DJI Air Unit / HD VTX 连接，协议默认为 DisplayPort。连接器第 1 引脚为 "
"9V，请勿将其连接至需要 5V 的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:73
#: d6934c266fb14d2aa64f54408f660df8
msgid "Outputs"
msgstr "输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:75
#: bc33b50baad54418a77af7663bbbf9df
msgid ""
"The AP-H743v2 supports up to 8 Servo/Motor outputs. All the channels support"
" DShot and BiDir DShot."
msgstr "AP-H743v2 支持最多 8 路舵机/电机输出，所有通道均支持 DShot 和双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:77
#: 1c9ef21f94b9471b801c0f41d371546f
msgid ""
"Outputs are grouped and every output within a group must use the same output"
" protocol:"
msgstr "输出分组，同组内每路输出必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:79
#: 5250aa20704146059e6a3dbd72ed2d4d
msgid "1, 2, 3, 4 are Group 1;"
msgstr "1、2、3、4 为第 1 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:80
#: 400c4fd78ba248609ab7f0ec71dc4ab8
msgid "5, 6 are Group 2;"
msgstr "5、6 为第 2 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:81
#: 0bb19d1ef0e34c0aaa999918dc96834a
msgid "7, 8 are Group 3;"
msgstr "7、8 为第 3 组；"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:84
#: 1019c1e959b04b48a30b1b4ac5f7d1bc
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:86
#: fc933c06b5c74ad598d1dbdcced5ec63
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器，ESC 连接器上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器最高支持 6S 锂电池。"

