#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:98
#: bb2e2dd4831046f7a100378fce2ce5b7
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:100
#: 4bbd5b27826c462cafce4a5590d6c3d4
msgid ""
"The AP-H743v2 has a built-in compass sensor (IST8310), and you can also "
"attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector. Due to "
"potential interference, the autopilot is usually used with an external I2C "
"compass as part of a GPS/Compass combination."
msgstr ""
"AP-H743v2 内置罗盘传感器（IST8310），也可通过 SDA 和 SCL 连接器以 I2C 连接外部罗盘。由于潜在干扰，飞控通常配合 "
"GPS/罗盘组合中的外部 I2C 罗盘使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:103
#: a7af27fe350d4fcaab395519b6c82695
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:104
#: f21a49cba1ac44cca208495b450d1cc0
msgid ""
"Firmware can be found on the `firmware server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in each vehicle's \"X-MAV-AP-H743v2\" "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"固件可在 `固件服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 各飞行器的 「X-MAV-AP-H743v2」 "
"目录中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:107
#: 735446648ba94ea2ad17abdd68304d2d
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:109
#: 2cd61a3305a54e579bf6e88a0fb7d7df
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 工具加载 「with_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-X_MAV_H743v2.rst:111
#: c74d6636f79f40358c1005abf98e42f4
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新时应使用 「\\*.apj」 固件文件。"
